  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A blank tally sheet for recording vaccinations. Header fields for date, region, district, health facility, location and service delivery strategy (fixed, outreach or mobile). Rows list antigens and items: BCG, Hep B BD, OPV 0-3, IPV, Penta 1-3, Rota 1-3, PCV 1-3, M/MR 1 and 2, DTP4/Other, vitamin A and long-lasting insecticidal net. Each row has rows of tally circles and a total for 0-11 months and for 12 months or older, and a total-vaccinated column. Cells that do not apply are shaded dark: Hep B BD and OPV 0 for 12 months or older, and M/MR 2, DTP4/Other and the net for 0-11 months. A footnote marks Rota 3, DTP4/Other and the net as depending on national health priorities and schedule of services.",
      "lang": "en",
